"способів, якими ми обчислили $x$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally, for this small problem we can compute the exact reference value "
"using "
"[scipy.linalg.expm](https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.linalg.expm.html)"
" as follows:\n"
